3.4. Number of sites evaluated, and Executive Projects developed for future rehabilitation of Regional Observatory Centers (INS) - Target: 3</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed target for 2021 has been transferred to 2022. It was due to delay in the initiation date of the project only September 2021 funds were received and additional requests to be added.

